notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:1:# Moving-Throat PDE — Stage 104: Exact Outgoing `l=2` DtN Fingerprint
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:5:Compute the canonical compact passive/outgoing quadrupole normalization directly from an explicit outgoing `l=2` Dirichlet-to-Neumann model instead of carrying the coefficient `chi_Q` symbolically.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:7:## Exact outgoing DtN model
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:18:The exact `l=2` outgoing DtN operator is
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:20:\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(z)
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:30:\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(z)
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:40:So the exact static slot is \(\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(0)=-3\).
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:48:\frac{\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(0)}{\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(z)}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:50:-\frac{3}{\Lambda_2^{\rm out}(z)}.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:78:+i\,\frac{a^5\omega^5}{27c_s^5}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:83:This is exactly the outgoing compact `l=2` fingerprint used earlier in the reduced 2.5PN program, but now derived directly from the explicit DtN model.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:87:The canonical outgoing coefficient is therefore not free. On the exact spherical outgoing `l=2` DtN branch, the leading odd quadrupole coefficient is fixed to
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:89:\Gamma_{5,\rm can}^{\rm DtN}=\frac{a^5}{27c_s^5}.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage104_outgoing_dtn_fingerprint.md:92:So any later normalization mismatch must come from branch selection or source normalization, not from ambiguity in the canonical outgoing `l=2` DtN model itself.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:1:# Moving-Throat PDE — Stage 105: Exact Fixing of `chi_Q`
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:5:Use the explicit DtN fingerprint to determine the last reduced 2.5PN scalar
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:7:\chi_Q
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:22:-i\,\chi_Q\,\sigma_Q^{\rm can}\,\omega^5
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:47:Expanding through \(O(\omega^5)\) gives
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:53:+i\,\chi_Q\,\frac{a^5\omega^5}{27c_s^5}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:57:From Stage 87, the explicit outgoing DtN branch gives
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:63:+i\,\frac{a^5\omega^5}{27c_s^5}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:67:Matching the \(O(\omega^5)\) coefficient yields
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:69:\boxed{\chi_Q=1.}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:72:So on the canonical compact passive/outgoing grouped-`P2` DtN branch, the last reduced normalization scalar is fixed exactly.
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:74:## General deformed DtN obstruction
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:76:A useful way to parametrize the only remaining PDE-facing freedom is to deform the outgoing DtN operator by
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:78:\Lambda_2^{\rm def}(z)
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:95:\boxed{\chi_Q=\xi_Q.}
notes/stages/moving_throat_pde_stage105_chiQ_fix_from_outgoing_dtn.md:98:That means the only reduced 2.5PN obstruction left after the present calculation is a deviation of the actual moving-throat DtN branch from the canonical outgoing `l=2` coefficient \(\xi_Q=1\).

